  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\n\nOne day you awake to find yourself in a mysterious room, that isn't like your typical bedroom. In fact, the room is better furnished and seems much more expensive than the items you own. The massive flat screen in front of you is new, and you wonder how much it could have cost, much less how you could ever afford it on your personal income. Turning to your right you see a bathroom, and you get out of bed to examine this luxurious bathroom. The bathroom, like the bedroom is much more elegant than your utilitarian restroom, having a much more massive shower with its own tub. You glance at the mirror to inspect yourself, and you are shocked at what you see.\n\nStaring in front of the mirror is none other than famous actor Matt Damon. Confused by this, you begin to think that maybe this is a dream. There is no logical way you could be Matt Damon, or even controlling his body. You were just an average person, who had an average life with an average job at the local hospital, not some renowned actor that earns millions per movie. \n\nSuddenly the door to your bathroom opens, and you are met by none other than your wife, Luciana. She wonders what is going on, as you normally do not spend so much time in the rest room inspecting yourself. You try to explain what has happened and how you have become Matt Damon, but she just looks at you crazily and does not believe you. She otherwise passes it off as an elaborate joke you are making, and suggests that you get ready to go to work.\n\nWork, you ponder, it surely meant a film shoot, and not your usual job at the hospital. Your mind was racing trying to piece together this new reality you were thrust into, and you couldn't help but think that your were way over your head. Grabbing Matt Damon's smart phone, you noticed a missed call, who left a voicemail. The message was from your agent, Alex saying to get to the film shoot in about an hour as you are needed for an important shot. You then panic, as you get the address to the film set, and you head out. You drive in a car that you don't recognize, and get to the set on time.\n\nThere everyone seems relived to see you arrive, and they thrust you onto the set.",
